
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DramaBox VF</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #10101b;
    color: white;
}

header {
    background: #19192a;
    padding: 20px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #7957ff;
}

header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #a58bff;
    font-size: 28px;
}

header p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: #ddd;
}

main {
    padding: 20px 15px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
}

h2 {
    color: #a58bff;
}

.search {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #555;
    background: #202033;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.empty {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    background: #19192a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 13px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>🎬 DramaBox VF</h1>
    <p>Vos dramas chinois en version française</p>
</header>

<main>
    <h2>Découvrir les dramas</h2>

    <input
        class="search"
        id="search"
        type="search"
        placeholder="🔎 Rechercher un drama..."
        aria-label="Rechercher un drama"
    >

    <section class="empty" id="catalogue">
        <h3>Bienvenue sur DramaBox VF !</h3>
        <p>Retrouvez ici vos films et dramas chinois en version française.</p>
        <p>🎥 Le catalogue vidéo sera ajouté prochainement.</p>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    DramaBox VF © 2026
</footer>

</body>
</html>
